# tb_TSPC_DFF_R: Q va QB mong doi cuoi moi chu ky 2 ns (lay mau tai (k+1)T - MARGIN)
T 2e-9
MARGIN 1e-11
STRICT 1
OUT Q QB
V 0 0 01 ; power-on: RST=1 -> Q=0
V 1 0 10 ; D=1 chot o canh 3n
V 2 0 10 ; D=1 giu
V 3 0 01 ; D=0 chot o canh 7n
V 4 0 01 ; D=0 nhieu chu ky (kiem glitch)
V 5 0 10 ; D=1 chot o canh 11n
V 6 0 01 ; D=0 chot o canh 13n
V 7 0 01 ; RST=1 luc CLK=1 (15.5-15.8n) -> Q=0 du D=1
V 8 0 10 ; D=1 chot o canh 17n
V 9 0 01 ; RST=1 luc CLK=0, giu qua canh 19n -> Q=0
V 10 0 10 ; nha RST, D=1 chot o canh 21n
